{"id": "bdf41465-369f-4e1c-981f-0f0738bc8a07", "slug": "explore-regions", "title": "Explore Regions", "description": "Explore Regions UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Explore Regions\"\ndescription: \"Explore Regions UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#DFCDC3\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#FCFBF9\"\n  surface: \"#DFCDC3\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#5C544D\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"4px\"\n  control: \"4px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Explore Regions\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 8; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: ui, css, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nExplore Regions UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nNavigate By Sector Select to expand 1 NORTHERN TERRITORY 2 EASTERN BLOC 3 TROPICAL ZONE 4 CENTRAL CORRIDOR 5 WESTERN PROVINCE 6 DESERT EXPANSE 7 HIGHLANDS 8 ISLAND CHAIN Currently Stationed In: SECTOR 07 By Sector Secto…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Navigate By Sector.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #DFCDC3, accent #000000, background #FCFBF9, surface #DFCDC3, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Explore Regions</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#fcfbf9] text-stone-600 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-rose-100 selection:text-stone-800 min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Canvas Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20\">\n\n        <!-- Header / Masked Reveal Title -->\n        <header class=\"w-full flex justify-center mb-16 md:mb-24\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-tight font-light flex gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"title-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">Navigate</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"title-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">By</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"title-word inline-block transform translate-y-full\">Sector</span></span>\n            </h1>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8\">\n\n            <!-- Left Sidebar Area -->\n            <aside class=\"lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-12\">\n\n                <!-- List Container with Gradient Border -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-sm p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-200/60 via-stone-200/30 to-transparent shadow-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm h-full w-full rounded-sm p-6 lg:p-8\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mb-8 font-medium\">Select to expand</p>\n\n                        <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\" id=\"region-list\">\n                            <!-- List Items -->\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">1</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">NORTHERN TERRITORY</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">2</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">EASTERN BLOC</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">3</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">TROPICAL ZONE</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">4</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">CENTRAL CORRIDOR</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">5</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">WESTERN PROVINCE</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">6</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">DESERT EXPANSE</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">7</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">HIGHLANDS</span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer sidebar-item opacity-0 transform -translate-x-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-rose-300 w-4 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\">8</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rhombus-linear\" class=\"text-rose-200 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-stone-600 group-hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors font-medium\">ISLAND CHAIN</span>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stamp / Current Location -->\n                <div class=\"relative ml-4 mt-8 lg:mt-16 stamp-element opacity-0 scale-90\">\n                    <!-- Circle Stamp -->\n                    <div class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full border border-stone-300/60 bg-stone-100/30 flex flex-col items-center justify-center absolute -top-12 -left-8 -rotate-6 backdrop-blur-sm z-0\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\" class=\"text-stone-400 mb-1\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500 text-center leading-tight\">Currently<br>Stationed<br>In:</span>\n                        <!-- Decorative wavy lines -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[-40px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-1 rotate-12 opacity-30\">\n                            <svg width=\"40\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 6\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1 3C5.5 -1 8.5 7 13 3C17.5 -1 20.5 7 25 3C29.5 -1 32.5 7 37 3\" stroke=\"#5c544d\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/></svg>\n                            <svg width=\"40\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 6\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1 3C5.5 -1 8.5 7 13 3C17.5 -1 20.5 7 25 3C29.5 -1 32.5 7 37 3\" stroke=\"#5c544d\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/></svg>\n                            <svg width=\"40\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 6\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1 3C5.5 -1 8.5 7 13 3C17.5 -1 20.5 7 25 3C29.5 -1 32.5 7 37 3\" stroke=\"#5c544d\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/></svg>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Box Stamp -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 bg-white border border-stone-300 rounded-[4px] px-6 py-4 shadow-sm inline-block transform rotate-2 ml-12 mt-6\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-stone-200 rounded-[4px] m-[2px]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-700 relative z-10 font-medium\">SECTOR 07</span>\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-stone-300 mt-2 relative z-10\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </aside>\n\n            <!-- Main Interactive Area -->\n            <section class=\"lg:col-span-9 flex flex-col\">\n\n                <!-- Top Controls -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 mb-16 top-controls opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Custom Dropdown -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full md:w-64\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-stone-50 border border-stone-200 shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgb(0,0,0,0.02)] rounded-sm py-3 px-4 flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer hover:border-stone-300 transition-colors\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-500 font-medium\">By Sector</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[2px]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-up-linear\" width=\"10\" class=\"text-stone-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"10\" class=\"text-stone-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Search Field -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full flex-1\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-stone-100/50 border border-transparent rounded-sm py-3 px-4 flex justify-between items-center focus-within:bg-white focus-within:border-stone-200 focus-within:shadow-sm transition-all\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"SEARCH DATABASE...\" class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none w-full text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-600 placeholder-stone-400 font-medium\" />\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-stone-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Map & Cards Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[16/10] bg-transparent mt-4 map-container\">\n\n                    <!-- Faint Abstract Map Pattern (CSS interpretation of the dotted background) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#8c8279 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 16px 16px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 20%, transparent 70%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 20%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Polaroids -->\n                    <!-- Polaroid 1 (Top Left) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-10\" style=\"top: 15%; left: 5%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform -rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Landscape\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 7</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -right-3 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">7</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 2 (Bottom Left) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-20\" style=\"top: 60%; left: 0%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform rotate-3 hover:-rotate-1 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472214103451-9374bd1c798e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Landscape\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 4</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -right-3 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">4</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 3 (Center Bottom) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-30\" style=\"top: 75%; left: 35%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform -rotate-1 hover:rotate-2 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Landscape\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 9</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">9</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 4 (Center Top) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-20\" style=\"top: 40%; left: 38%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform rotate-2 hover:-rotate-2 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518548419970-58e3b4079ab2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Landscape\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 3</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">3</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 5 (Right Top) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-10\" style=\"top: 8%; left: 65%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-1 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486299267070-83823f5448dd?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"City\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 5</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 -left-4 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">5</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 6 (Right Mid) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-20\" style=\"top: 45%; left: 75%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform rotate-1 hover:-rotate-1 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473116763249-2faaef81ccda?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Desert\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 6</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-4 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">6</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                     <!-- Polaroid 7 (Far Right Top) -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-30\" style=\"top: 25%; right: 0%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform -rotate-2 hover:rotate-2 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505302767374-66be55b06d48?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Tropical\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-4 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">2</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Polaroid 8 (Far Right Bottom) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute polaroid z-10\" style=\"bottom: 0%; right: 10%;\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center transform rotate-2 hover:-rotate-1 transition-transform duration-300 hover:z-50 cursor-pointer group\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-100\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499793983690-e29da59ef1c2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400\" alt=\"Beach\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 mt-2 mb-1\">Sector 8</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 right-1/2 translate-x-1/2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#dfcdc3] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shadow-sm font-medium\">8</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n        // Title Masked Reveal\n        tl.to(\".title-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        // Sidebar Elements Stagger\n        tl.to(\".sidebar-item\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            x: 0,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            ease: \"power2.out\",\n            stagger: 0.05\n        }, \"-=0.5\");\n\n        // Stamp Reveal\n        tl.to(\".stamp-element\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            scale: 1,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            ease: \"back.out(1.5)\"\n        }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n        // Top Controls Fade In\n        tl.to(\".top-controls\", {\n            opacity: 1,\n            y: 0,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            ease: \"power2.out\"\n        }, \"-=0.6\");\n\n        // Polaroids Pop In\n        gsap.set(\".polaroid\", { scale: 0.8, opacity: 0 });\n\n        ScrollTrigger.batch(\".polaroid\", {\n            onEnter: elements => {\n                gsap.to(elements, {\n                    scale: 1,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    ease: \"back.out(1.2)\",\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    overwrite: true\n                });\n            },\n            once: true\n        });\n\n        // Floating animation for polaroids\n        const polaroids = document.querySelectorAll('.polaroid');\n        polaroids.forEach((polaroid, index) => {\n            gsap.to(polaroid, {\n                y: \"random(-10, 10)\",\n                x: \"random(-5, 5)\",\n                rotation: `random(${-3 + index}, ${3 - index})`,\n                duration: \"random(3, 5)\",\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                delay: index * 0.2\n            });\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Lines Background (Subtle Three.js setup)\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 100;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create curved lines geometry\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const points = [];\n            const particlesCount = 200;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particlesCount; i++) {\n                points.push(\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 400,\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 400,\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 200\n                );\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(points, 3));\n\n            const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0xdfcdc3, // Rose/beige tint matching theme\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.2,\n                linewidth: 1\n            });\n\n            // Using LineSegments to connect random points for an abstract network feel\n            const lines = new THREE.LineSegments(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(lines);\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                // Slow rotation for dynamic feel\n                lines.rotation.x += 0.0002;\n                lines.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL if not on strict mobile to save battery\n        if (window.innerWidth > 768) {\n            initWebGL();\n        }\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "explore-regions.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/explore-regions.jpg", "source_name": "explore-regions-DESIGN.md", "views": 80, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T10:59:14.795723+00:00"}